# E03_01 - PPU timing, modes, STAT, LCDC
Role: CODE
Goal: Replace the stub: dot-exact line/frame timing, modes 0-3, STAT, VBlank.
Prerequisites: E02_46
Read (max 3 files, give line ranges): docs/annexes/notes/04a_video_regs.md (1-150); docs/annexes/notes/04b_video_render.md (1-150); docs/annexes/decisions.md (A_01)
Write only in: crates/puce8gb-core/src/video/, crates/puce8gb-core/src/bus.rs, crates/puce8gb-core/src/machine.rs
## Work
1. Ppu struct stepped per tick at the ratio of A_01. 456 dots per line, 154 lines. LY, LYC, mode bits per the note.
2. STAT interrupt line with edge detection and source blocking per the note; VBlank interrupt at the right dot.
3. LCDC bit 7: LCD off holds the PPU in reset (LY=0, mode 0), LCD on restarts per the note (first line differs).
4. Registers LCDC STAT SCY SCX LY LYC WY WX BGP OBP0 OBP1 wired on the bus.
5. Tests: mode sequence over one line and one frame, LY/LYC match flag, STAT blocking, LCD off/on.
## Rules
- Identifiers and comments in English, ASCII only. Zero invention: unknown => UNKNOWN - to confirm.
- Name every unit test fn starting with `e03_01_` (the check filters on it).
- Integer dot counter; no frame-at-once shortcuts.
## Exit tests
- unit tests e03_01_* pass (at least one)
- cargo fmt --check, clippy -D warnings, cargo test --workspace (added automatically)
- non-regression: all earlier exit tests (run by `done`)
